{"id":"NCT07373639","title":"A Long-term Follow-up Study in Patients Who Received BEAM-101","official":"A Long-term Follow-up Study in Patients With Hemoglobinopathy Who Received Autologous CD34+ Edited Hematopoietic Stem Cells","summary":"This is a Long-term Follow-up (LTFU) study in patients who received BEAM-101 in the parent study (Study BTX-AUT-001). Eligible patients who received BEAM-101 will be asked to participate in this LTFU study prior to completing Study BTX-AUT-001. Patients who enter into this study will be followed for 13 years (a total of 15 years after receiving BEAM-101).","conditions":["Hemoglobinopathy","Sickle Cell Disease"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Long-Term Follow-up Study of patients who received BEAM-101"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n1. Have received BEAM-101 in Study BTX-AUT-001 and are in the process of completing that study's end-of-study (EOS) visit.\n2. Provide signed, written informed consent according to local institutional review board (IRB)/independent ethics committee (IEC) and institutional requirements.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* There are no exclusion criteria for this study.","minAge":"14 Years","maxAge":"37 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":50,"start":"2025-12-15","pcd":"2043-02-12","upd":"2026-01-28","sponsor":"Beam Therapeutics Inc.","areas":["other"],"central":["Medical Information · +1 857-327-8641 · clinicalinfo@beamtx.com"],"sites":[{"f":"University of Alabama at Birmingham","city":"Birmingham","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35233","s":"NYR","lat":33.5207,"lon":-86.8025,"c":"Medical Information · 8573278641 · clinicalinfo@beamtx.com"},{"f":"Phoenix Children's Hospital","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85016","s":"NYR","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Medical Information · 8573278641 · clinicalinfo@beamtx.com"},{"f":"Mayo Clinic Florida","city":"Jacksonville","pr":"Florida","zip":"32224","s":"NYR","lat":30.3322,"lon":-81.6556,"c":"Medical Inform